{"seq":3,"slug":"imaging-deconvolution","title":"成像与去卷积","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/radio-astronomy/interferometry/imaging-deconvolution","wordCount":1742,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"成像与去卷积\">成像与去卷积</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><a href=\"aperture-synthesis-vlbi\">综合孔径与 VLBI</a>留下了一个无法回避的事实：无论地球转多久、天线排多巧，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 平面的采样永远有缝隙。把这些带缝的可见度直接做傅里叶反变换，得到的不是真实天图，而是一张被&quot;采样图案&quot;卷积过的&quot;脏图&quot;——真实源的周围环绕着一圈圈虚假的旁瓣纹路。把脏图还原成可信的天图，是干涉成像最核心也最像&quot;炼金术&quot;的一步：去卷积。这一篇讲清从可见度到最终图像的完整管线——加权、脏图、CLEAN、自校准——它把<a href=\"interferometry-principles\">范西特-策尼克定理</a>的理论真正变成可发表的科学图像。</p>\n<p>成像管线的核心矛盾是：测到的是不完整的傅里叶分量，要恢复完整图像必须引入先验假设（如&quot;天空主要是点源/紧致结构&quot;）。CLEAN 算法及其变体就是这套假设的工程化身。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[校准后可见度 V] --&gt; B[uv 加权&lt;br/&gt;自然/均匀/Briggs]&#10;  B --&gt; C[傅里叶反变换]&#10;  C --&gt; D[脏图 = 真图 ⊛ 脏束]&#10;  C --&gt; E[脏束 PSF]&#10;  D --&gt; F[CLEAN 去卷积]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[CLEAN 成分表]&#10;  G --&gt; H[卷积洁束 + 残差]&#10;  H --&gt; I[最终洁图]&#10;  I --&gt; J{动态范围够吗?}&#10;  J --&gt;|否| K[自校准] --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[校准后可见度 V] --&gt; B[uv 加权&lt;br/&gt;自然/均匀/Briggs]\n  B --&gt; C[傅里叶反变换]\n  C --&gt; D[脏图 = 真图 ⊛ 脏束]\n  C --&gt; E[脏束 PSF]\n  D --&gt; F[CLEAN 去卷积]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[CLEAN 成分表]\n  G --&gt; H[卷积洁束 + 残差]\n  H --&gt; I[最终洁图]\n  I --&gt; J{动态范围够吗?}\n  J --&gt;|否| K[自校准] --&gt; A</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>关键选择</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>uv 加权</td>\n<td>平衡分辨率与灵敏度</td>\n<td>自然/均匀/Briggs robust</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反变换</td>\n<td>可见度→脏图</td>\n<td>网格化+FFT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>去卷积</td>\n<td>去除脏束旁瓣</td>\n<td>CLEAN/最大熵/RML</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自校准</td>\n<td>修正残余相位</td>\n<td>需足够信噪比</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"脏图与脏束\">脏图与脏束</h2><p>不完整的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 采样可以写成&quot;真实可见度&quot;乘以一个采样函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（有数据处为 1、无数据处为 0）。根据傅里叶变换的卷积定理，脏图就等于真实天图与采样函数的傅里叶变换——脏束（即点扩散函数 PSF）——的卷积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∗</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\rm dirty} = I_{\\rm true} * B_{\\rm dirty}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">dirty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">true</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">dirty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>脏束因 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的缝隙而长满了旁瓣（&quot;脏&quot;由此得名）。一颗孤立点源在脏图里不是一个干净的点，而是脏束本身的样子：中心一个主峰，四周一圈圈起伏的纹路。当天空有多个源时，每个源的脏束旁瓣互相叠加，图像迅速变得无法解读。去卷积的任务，就是把这些已知形状的脏束旁瓣从图里&quot;减&quot;出去。</p>\n<p>加权在这一步就介入了：自然加权（按数据密度加权）灵敏度最高但分辨率较低、旁瓣较差；均匀加权分辨率最高但灵敏度损失；Briggs 的 robust 参数在两者间连续调节，是实践中最常用的折中。加权选择没有标准答案，取决于科学目标更看重看清精细结构还是探测微弱源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"clean-迭代式去卷积\">CLEAN：迭代式去卷积</h2><p>CLEAN 是射电成像四十年来的主力算法，思路朴素而强大：假设天空由一系列点源构成，就反复地&quot;找最亮点、减脏束&quot;。每一轮在残差图里找到最强像素，记下它的位置和一小部分（增益因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>，常取 0.1）强度作为一个 CLEAN 成分，再从残差图里减去这个成分对应的脏束，如此迭代直到残差降到噪声水平。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\rm residual}^{(k+1)} = I_{\\rm residual}^{(k)} - \\gamma\\,a_k\\,B_{\\rm dirty}(\\cdot - \\vec x_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3461em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">residual</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3461em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">residual</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">dirty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>最后把所有 CLEAN 成分用一个理想的&quot;洁束&quot;（脏束主瓣拟合成的高斯）重新卷积，再加回残差，得到最终洁图。这一步等价于人为补全了缺失的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 信息——所以干涉图像的分辨率本质上是&quot;被假设出来&quot;的，必须诚实标注洁束大小。CLEAN 有众多变体：多尺度 CLEAN 处理弥散结构，Cotton-Schwab 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 域减成分以提精度。对 <a href=\"aperture-synthesis-vlbi\">EHT</a> 这类极稀疏阵列，则改用正则化最大似然（RML）等贝叶斯方法，把&quot;图像应平滑/稀疏&quot;作为显式先验——黑洞影像正是这类方法的产物。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自校准-用数据自己修自己\">自校准：用数据自己修自己</h2><p>即便去卷积做得完美，残余的相位误差（大气、仪器）仍会限制图像的动态范围。自校准（self-calibration）是一记巧妙的回马枪：先用初步的 CLEAN 模型当作&quot;已知天图&quot;，反推每台天线应有的复增益，再用这个增益修正原始可见度，然后重新成像——如此模型与校准交替迭代，图像越来越干净。</p>\n<p>它能成立，是因为天线数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 给出的基线数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(N-1)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 远多于待解的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个天线增益，方程超定，可以解出增益而不需要外部校准源。这本质上是<a href=\"../telescopes/receivers-noise\">接收机与噪声</a>里复增益定标思想在阵列上的自洽闭环，也是闭合相位/闭合振幅这类对增益误差免疫的量之所以宝贵的原因——VLBI 与 EHT 严重依赖它们。自校准把动态范围从几百提升到数十万，是现代高保真成像（如 MeerKAT、<a href=\"../science/ska-future\">SKA</a> 深场）的标配。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>对先验的依赖</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CLEAN</td>\n<td>点源/紧致源为主</td>\n<td>弱（点源假设）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多尺度 CLEAN</td>\n<td>含弥散结构</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大熵/RML</td>\n<td>极稀疏 uv（EHT）</td>\n<td>强（平滑/稀疏）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自校准</td>\n<td>提升动态范围</td>\n<td>需初始模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三者如何协同-动态范围从哪来\">三者如何协同：动态范围从哪来</h2><p>成像管线的三步并非各自独立，而是层层解锁对方的瓶颈。加权决定脏图的&quot;底子&quot;，但加权再优也无法消除采样缝隙带来的脏束旁瓣；CLEAN 正是针对这层伪影，用点源假设把它们逐轮减掉；而 CLEAN 之后残留的相位误差，则要靠自校准这一层来擦除。每上一层，动态范围——图像中最亮结构与最暗可辨结构的比值——就被推高一截：从脏图里只有几百，到 CLEAN 后数千，再到自校准后的数十万。</p>\n<p>理解这条链条的实用价值在于定位问题：若图像里是规则的环形纹路，多半是去卷积没做够、脏束旁瓣未被充分减除；若出现成片条纹或结构错位，则通常是残余相位作祟，该轮到自校准上场。诊断&quot;脏在哪一层&quot;，比盲目加大 CLEAN 迭代次数更能有效提升图像质量，这也是现代成像流水线把这三步反复串联、而非一次做完的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 采样永远不完整，直接反变换得到的是真图与脏束卷积的&quot;脏图&quot;，脏束因采样缝隙长满旁瓣（详见<a href=\"aperture-synthesis-vlbi\">综合孔径</a>）。</li>\n<li>uv 加权（自然/均匀/Briggs）在分辨率与灵敏度间权衡，是成像第一道工程选择。</li>\n<li>CLEAN 迭代地&quot;找峰-减脏束&quot;，最后用洁束重卷积补全缺失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 信息；EHT 等稀疏阵列改用 RML 等贝叶斯方法，依赖显式图像先验。</li>\n<li>自校准利用基线数远超天线数的超定性，用数据自身反解复增益，把动态范围提升数个量级，是现代高保真<a href=\"../science/ska-future\">成像</a>与 VLBI 的标配。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"成像与去卷积","id":"成像与去卷积"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"脏图与脏束","id":"脏图与脏束"},{"level":2,"text":"CLEAN：迭代式去卷积","id":"clean-迭代式去卷积"},{"level":2,"text":"自校准：用数据自己修自己","id":"自校准-用数据自己修自己"},{"level":2,"text":"三者如何协同：动态范围从哪来","id":"三者如何协同-动态范围从哪来"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"综合孔径与 VLBI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/radio-astronomy/interferometry/aperture-synthesis-vlbi"},"next":{"title":"谱线与 21 厘米","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/radio-astronomy/science/spectral-lines-21cm"}}